<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Ben Digital Hub</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#08111f;color:white}
header{padding:20px;background:#1261d6;text-align:center}
header h1{margin:0}
nav{margin-top:12px}
nav a{color:white;text-decoration:none;margin:8px}
.hero{text-align:center;padding:70px 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#123c8c,#07101f)}
.hero h2{font-size:40px}
.hero span{color:#55aaff}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:#1683ff;color:white;padding:13px 25px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;margin-top:15px}
section{padding:45px 20px;max-width:1000px;margin:auto}
h2{text-align:center}
.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:18px}
.card{background:#111f33;padding:25px;border-radius:15px;border:1px solid #263b59}
.card h3{color:#55aaff}
.card p{color:#cbd5e1}
.contact{text-align:center}
footer{text-align:center;padding:25px;background:#050b14;color:#94a3b8}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<h1>Ben Digital Hub</h1>
<nav>
<a href="#home">Home</a>
<a href="#about">About</a>
<a href="#content">Content</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>
</header>

<section class="hero" id="home">
<h2>Welcome to <span>Ben Digital Hub</span></h2>
<p>Football, Gaming, Technology and Digital Content.</p>
<a class="btn" href="#content">Explore</a>
</section>

<section id="about">
<h2>About Me</h2>
<p style="text-align:center">
Welcome to my personal website. Here I share football,
gaming, technology tips and interesting digital content.
</p>
</section>

<section id="content">
<h2>My Content</h2>

<div class="cards">

<div class="card">
<h3>⚽ Football</h3>
<p>Football news, players, clubs and match information.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>🎮 Gaming</h3>
<p>FC Mobile, Dream League Soccer and gaming tips.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>📱 Technology</h3>
<p>Phone tips, apps, websites and useful technology guides.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>📝 Articles</h3>
<p>Interesting stories, guides and useful information.</p>
</div>

</div>
</section>

<section class="contact" id="contact">
<h2>Contact Me</h2>
<p>For business, advertising or collaboration.</p>
<a class="btn" href="mailto:your@email.com">Email Me</a>
</section>

<footer>
© 2026 Ben Digital Hub
</footer>

</body>
</html>
